%% Communities Intel disambiguation — listings / RTA / offplan / DLD / LI spatial / persona / Think lock.
%% Companion note: communities_intel.md
flowchart TD
    Q[UserQuery] --> List{"listing filters beds price show me?"}
    List -->|yes pure inventory| PS[property_search_only]
    List -->|no| Mob{"station route ridership Salik NOL?"}

    Mob -->|yes live network| RTA[rta_intel_not_communities_intel]
    Mob -->|no| Off{"named developer project brochure handover?"}

    Off -->|yes catalog only| OP[offplan_projects]
    Off -->|no| Dld{"historical prices volumes raw DLD txn?"}

    Dld -->|yes pure market| MI[market_intel]
    Dld -->|no| Spatial{"POI rank lat lng buildings catalog?"}

    Spatial -->|yes spatial only| LI[location_intel_not_communities_intel]
    Spatial -->|no| Life{"lifestyle schools what is X like who lives here?"}

    Life -->|yes| Neigh{"which neighbourhoods are near?"}
    Neigh -->|yes or lifestyle| CI[communities_intel]
    Life -->|no| Persona{"persona alias intent?"}

    Persona -->|buyer_fit| Buyer[communities_intel_plus_property_search]
    Persona -->|investor_intelligence| Inv[market_intel_plus_communities_intel]
    Persona -->|rental_intel| Rent[CI_plus_MI_plus_property_search]
    Persona -->|no| Think{"think.intent == communities_intel?"}

    Think -->|yes exclusive| Guard[skip_sql_agents_must_be_false]
    Guard --> CiOnly[communities_intel_ReAct]
    Think -->|CI plus developer payment-plan gap| CiOp[communities_intel_plus_offplan]
    Think -->|CI plus yield DLD volume gap| CiMi[communities_intel_plus_market_intel]
    Think -->|CI plus POI-rank lat lng gap| CiLi[communities_intel_plus_location_intel]
    Think -->|CI plus listing filters| CiPs[communities_intel_plus_property_search]
    Think -->|hybrid mobility plus lifestyle| Multi[multi_intel_hybrid_add_CI]

    PS --> Route[route_to_agents]
    RTA --> Route
    OP --> Route
    MI --> Route
    LI --> Route
    CI --> Route
    Buyer --> Route
    Inv --> Route
    Rent --> Route
    CiOnly --> Route
    CiOp --> Route
    CiMi --> Route
    CiLi --> Route
    CiPs --> Route
    Multi --> Route
